    <string name="guide_title">What to do now (works offline)</string>
    <string name="guide_1">When officials say so, go to the nearest cyclone shelter. Take elderly, disabled, pregnant women and children first.</string>
    <string name="guide_2">Do not walk or drive into floodwater.</string>
    <string name="guide_3">Stay away from fallen electric wires.</string>
    <string name="guide_4">Keep documents, medicines, water, dry food and a torch in one bag.</string>
    <string name="guide_5">Save battery: turn off mobile data, keep calls, SMS and Bluetooth on.</string>
    <string name="guide_6">Do not leave the shelter until officials say it is safe.</string>
